  "id": "speaking/while-the-room-listens-what-the-agent-has-in-mind-makes-it-offer",
  "title": "While the room listens, what the agent has in mind that answers or corrects the turn as surely as its proactivity asks makes it offer, the room going on listening, when the speaker has finished, neither postpones it nor asks for quiet, and no question put to someone else waits for them; otherwise the agent is silent",
  "rules": [
    "§6.4",
    "§6.8"
  ],
  "requirements": [
    "RK-6.4-164"
  ],
  "notes": "In each room, Alice's request to only listen is a final silence; the thinker thinks meanwhile and comes back with something to say, so the policy is asked again on that turn, late, with the thought, as the room listens. In room-1 a question of Bob's to Alice waits for her first try, and the agent stays silent; on Bob's next turn, which the thought answers and no one else is waited for, the agent offers, asking for the floor, and the turn after it is still asked as the room listens. In r2 to r6 the late decision weighs the thought against a speaker not finished, postponing, asking for quiet, a judgment below the proactivity (0.5 by default), and a correction. Python: speaking/classifier.py _wants_the_floor.",
